/// Writes sparse posting lists into a blockfile.
///
/// Supports both fresh builds and incremental forks from an existing
/// [`MaxScoreReader`]. On [`commit`](Self::commit) every affected dimension is
/// rewritten in full: existing entries are pulled from the optional
/// `old_reader` and the accumulated delta (adds / updates / deletes) is applied
/// on top before the posting list is re-chunked into blocks.
#[derive(Clone)]
